ull warehouse management</p></div><div class="text-center" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><p class="text-4xl font-bold text-[#6172F3] mb-2">Buy Shipping</p><p class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-1">Shipping Integration</p><p class="text-sm text-neutral-600">Amazon &amp; Walmart native</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 bg-shades" id="how-it-works"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-6xl"><div class="mb-12" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-neutral-900 font-satoshi mb-4">Order Flow in 4 Steps</h2></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-8"><div class="flex flex-col" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-6 w-6 text-[#6172F3]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-2 font-satoshi">Connect Warehouse</h3><p class="text-neutral-600">Link your 3PL warehouse through Ecom Circles. We handle API integration and credentials so you don&#x27;t have to.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-package h-6 w-6 text-[#6172F3]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11 21.73a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73z"></path><path d="M12 22V12"></path><polyline points="3.29 7 12 12 20.71 7"></polyline><path d="m7.5 4.27 9 5.15"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-2 font-satoshi">Orders Route Automatically</h3><p class="text-neutral-6